      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really big red lump on my back that's gotten huge overnight. its super painful and throbbing, and the skin around it feels really hot to the touch. it feels like there is fluid trapped under there and the pressure is driving me crazy. what can i do to get the fluid out and relieve the pressure so it stops hurting so much?",
